  "note": "마노의 방 (room.js, room-items.js): the 마노 강화 tab's room. It grows in six stages with the coin stats' levels added up (all six stats; nothing else, nothing stored: the stage is always worked out again from the save's levels, so a save that already has levels shows its stage at once). need: the levels in all a stage takes (the stats have no common top: four of them have none, so the steps follow the levels players have: about 25 by chapter 5, 100 by chapter 10, 190 by chapter 15, 250 by chapter 20; the last stage comes about chapter 25). Each stage is one whole picture of the room (Astra's 6-stage set; scripts/survivor-room-assets.py), shown at its own 16:9 and faded into the next. It gives nothing but the look. Everything below is in the picture's own pixels (size). walk: where feet may go on the open floor (rects x0 y0 x1 y1). spots: places in the room (at: where someone stands or lies, feet; from: the first stage that has it; door: where one steps from the floor to it; face: where Mano looks; line: what she says there; punch: she hits it). ball: where the toy ball starts. Mano and the cats are their sprites from the fight (the same pictures, the same colours) and a still pose each (art.poses) where they rest. reactions: what Mano says when a stat is bought.",
